---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="StarterCulture — AI-native software studio"
  description="StarterCulture is a small software development studio building AI-native products, starting with Devlore."
>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap header-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="#top">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 140" role="img" aria-label="StarterCulture">
          <defs>
            <clipPath id="jarClipNav"><rect x="38" y="34" width="64" height="78" rx="14"/></clipPath>
          </defs>
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="140" height="140" rx="24" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <rect x="54" y="10" width="32" height="12" rx="3" fill="#B5482B"/>
          <rect x="58" y="20" width="24" height="14" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="#B5482B" stroke-width="4"/>
          <rect x="38" y="34" width="64" height="78" rx="14" fill="none" stroke="#B5482B" stroke-width="4"/>
          <rect x="38" y="70" width="64" height="42" fill="#B5482B" clip-path="url(#jarClipNav)"/>
          <circle cx="58" cy="95" r="5" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <circle cx="75" cy="100" r="4" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <circle cx="68" cy="82" r="3" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <circle cx="70" cy="55" r="4" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <circle cx="63" cy="42" r="2.5" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <text x="170" y="88" font-family="Georgia, serif" font-size="36" font-weight="600" fill="#2B2320">StarterCulture</text>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <nav>
        <a href="#about">Studio</a>
        <a href="#products">Products</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">

    <section class="hero wrap">
      <div class="hero-brand">
        <svg class="mark" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 140 140" role="img" aria-label="StarterCulture mark">
          <defs>
            <clipPath id="jarClipHero"><rect x="38" y="34" width="64" height="78" rx="14"/></clipPath>
          </defs>
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="140" height="140" rx="24" fill="#FBF8F1" stroke="#EEE5D3" stroke-width="1"/>
          <rect x="54" y="10" width="32" height="12" rx="3" fill="#B5482B"/>
          <rect x="58" y="20" width="24" height="14" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="#B5482B" stroke-width="4"/>
          <rect x="38" y="34" width="64" height="78" rx="14" fill="none" stroke="#B5482B" stroke-width="4"/>
          <rect x="38" y="70" width="64" height="42" fill="#B5482B" clip-path="url(#jarClipHero)"/>
          <circle cx="58" cy="95" r="5" fill="#FBF8F1"/>
          <circle cx="75" cy="100" r="4" fill="#FBF8F1"/>
          <circle cx="68" cy="82" r="3" fill="#FBF8F1"/>
          <circle cx="70" cy="55" r="4" fill="#FBF8F1"/>
          <circle cx="63" cy="42" r="2.5" fill="#FBF8F1"/>
        </svg>
        <span>StarterCulture Software Studio</span>
      </div>

      <h1>Small studio. Big ideas. AI-native.</h1>
      <p class="lede">StarterCulture is a small software development studio. We build with AI as a first-class collaborator from the very first line of code — not bolted on after the fact.</p>

      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#products">See what we're building</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="eyebrow">The Studio</span>
          <h2>AI-native, from day one</h2>
          <p>We're a small team that builds software the way a good culture grows — deliberately, and with the right conditions from the start.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-grid">
          <div class="about-card">
            <div class="num">01</div>
            <h3>Small by design</h3>
            <p>A lean studio, not a large agency. Fewer people, higher leverage, faster decisions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-card">
            <div class="num">02</div>
            <h3>AI-native, not AI-added</h3>
            <p>AI is part of how we design and build from the outset — a core collaborator in the workflow, not a feature bolted on later.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="about-card">
            <div class="num">03</div>
            <h3>Built to last</h3>
            <p>We favor durable, well-documented systems over quick throwaway builds — software meant to grow with the teams that use it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="products">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="eyebrow">Products</span>
          <h2>What we're building</h2>
          <p>Our own products, built the same AI-native way we build for others.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="product-card">
          <div class="product-icon">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B5482B" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20"/>
              <path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="product-title-row">
              <h3>Devlore</h3>
              <span class="status-pill">Beta</span>
            </div>
            <p>Devlore is an agentic knowledge base that automatically documents every push across your project repos, with human review only at release time.</p>
            <a class="product-link" href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@starterculture/devlore" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View on npm →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;">
        <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: 28px;">
          <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
          <h2>Let's talk</h2>
          <p>Interested in working together, or want to hear more about what we're building?</p>
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:dev@starterculturestudio.com">dev@starterculturestudio.com</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 140 140" role="img" aria-label="StarterCulture">
          <defs>
            <clipPath id="jarClipFoot"><rect x="38" y="34" width="64" height="78" rx="14"/></clipPath>
          </defs>
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="140" height="140" rx="24" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <rect x="54" y="10" width="32" height="12" rx="3" fill="#B5482B"/>
          <rect x="58" y="20" width="24" height="14" rx="4" fill="none" stroke="#B5482B" stroke-width="4"/>
          <rect x="38" y="34" width="64" height="78" rx="14" fill="none" stroke="#B5482B" stroke-width="4"/>
          <rect x="38" y="70" width="64" height="42" fill="#B5482B" clip-path="url(#jarClipFoot)"/>
          <circle cx="58" cy="95" r="5" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <circle cx="75" cy="100" r="4" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <circle cx="68" cy="82" r="3" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <circle cx="70" cy="55" r="4" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
          <circle cx="63" cy="42" r="2.5" fill="#F5EFE1"/>
        </svg>
        <span>© 2026 StarterCulture</span>
      </div>
      <a href="mailto:dev@starterculturestudio.com">dev@starterculturestudio.com</a>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  :root {
    --cream: #F5EFE1;
    --paper: #FBF8F1;
    --terracotta: #B5482B;
    --terracotta-dark: #93381F;
    --brown: #2B2320;
    --brown-soft: #6B5D52;
    --line: rgba(43, 35, 32, 0.10);
    --radius: 16px;
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--brown);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.55;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .wrap {
    max-width: 1040px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 28px;
  }

  /* Header */
  header {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 10;
    background: rgba(245, 239, 225, 0.88);
    backdrop-filter: saturate(140%) blur(10px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .header-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 16px 0;
  }

  .brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--brown);
  }

  .brand svg { height: 30px; width: auto; display: block; }

  nav { display: flex; gap: 28px; }

  nav a {
    color: var(--brown-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.15s ease;
  }

  nav a:hover { color: var(--terracotta); }

  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    padding: 96px 0 80px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }

  .hero-brand .mark {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    display: block;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .hero-brand span {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--brown-soft);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: Georgia, "Iowan Old Style", "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5.5vw, 54px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 19px;
    color: var(--brown-soft);
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    margin-top: 36px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 13px 26px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--terracotta);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--terracotta-dark);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--brown);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: var(--terracotta);
    color: var(--terracotta);
  }

  /* Sections */
  section { padding: 72px 0; }

  .section-header {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-header .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 12px; }

  h2 {
    font-family: Georgia, "Iowan Old Style", "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 34px);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .section-header p {
    color: var(--brown-soft);
    font-size: 17px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* About */
  #about {
    background: var(--paper);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .about-card {
    text-align: left;
  }

  .about-card .num {
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--terracotta);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .about-card h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-card p {
    color: var(--brown-soft);
    font-size: 15px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Products */
  .product-card {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 40px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .product-icon {
    flex: none;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--cream);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .product-icon svg { width: 28px; height: 28px; }

  .product-title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .product-title-row h3 {
    font-size: 21px;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .status-pill {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--terracotta-dark);
    background: rgba(181, 72, 43, 0.10);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }

  .product-card p {
    color: var(--brown-soft);
    font-size: 16px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .product-link {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--terracotta);
  }

  .product-link:hover {
    color: var(--terracotta-dark);
  }

  /* Footer */
  footer {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 40px 0;
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--brown-soft);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .footer-brand svg { height: 22px; width: auto; }

  footer a {
    color: var(--brown-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  footer a:hover { color: var(--terracotta); }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    nav { display: none; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
    .product-card { flex-direction: column; padding: 28px; }
    section { padding: 56px 0; }
    .hero { padding: 64px 0 56px; }
  }
</style>
